      "@id": "http://www.sal.disco.unimib.it/technologies/unimib-shar/",
      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "dct:title": "UniMiB SHAR",
      "dct:description": "Smartphone accelerometer measurements for human activity recognition and fall detection. The accompanying readme.txt documents 11,771 prepared windows, 17 activity classes and 30 subjects. data/acc_data.mat contains 11,771 rows of 453 values (151 values per axis); acc_labels.mat contains activity, subject and trial identifiers. full_data.mat contains full recordings and subject attributes. ADL, fall and two-class variants and cross-validation files are also included; these representations must not be treated as independent observations without checking their relationships. Preserve the accompanying readme.txt and inspect source MATLAB code for interpretation. Source files were supplied locally from Downloads/UniMiB-SHAR. A dataset license has not been established; no license or publication date is inferred from the associated paper.",
      "dct:identifier": "unimib-shar",
